            ],
            "statement": "A trial Run is admitted only when the gateway's platform-wide model budget, less what is already spent and less the ceiling of every unfinished Run, still covers this Run's ceiling. Otherwise the preflight summary is blocked with platform_model_budget and creating the Run is refused for the same reason: no Run is created and nothing is charged, and the refusal says the budget recovers at 08:00 Taipei time. A budget or count that cannot be read admits the Run, because the gateway still enforces its own budget.",
