            "summary": "An import URL holding a query, a fragment or credentials is refused before any request, without echoing them."
          },
          {
            "id": "an-improvement-to-a-superseded-version-is-refused",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "Saving an improved version is refused with ErrBaseVersionMoved when the Skill's newest version is no longer the version the improvement was made to; content identical to an existing version is deduplicated first."
          },
          {
            "id": "every-redirect-hop-stays-on-the-host-allow-list",
            "status": "reviewed",
