            "summary": "While a Skill is under an access restriction, its version diffs reveal no content; the request answers 403."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-restriction-reason-must-be-known",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "Restricting a skill with a reason code outside the known set is refused, listing the known codes."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-skill-is-taken-down-once",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "A Skill already taken down cannot be taken down again, except that an operator's takedown supersedes the owner's own: the Skill stays down, now as the operator's, and only an operator lifts it. Any other second attempt is refused and the Skill stays down."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-skill-listing-page-stays-in-bounds",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "The Skill listing accepts a limit of 1 to 100 and a non-negative offset; any other value, including an empty or non-integer one, is refused."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-skill-version-changes-only-once-to-erase-its-content",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "A skill version row never changes except once, to erase its content: that one update sets content_erased_at and must leave the manifest empty and the import source cleared, may change nothing else, and freezes the row again."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-source-skill-outlives-purge-while-a-fork-stays",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "A purge keeps a source skill while any fork of it stays, transitively down fork chains."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-takedown-needs-a-reason",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "A takedown with an empty or whitespace-only reason is refused and the Skill stays up."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-taken-down-skill-cannot-be-forked",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "Forking a taken-down skill finds nothing."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-taken-down-skills-package-is-not-current",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "A taken-down skill's package is never reported as current content."
          },
          {
            "id": "a-text-diff-stops-at-one-mib-per-file",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "A file larger than 1 MiB on either side gets no text diff; exactly 1 MiB is diffed."
          },
          {
            "id": "an-access-restriction-needs-a-reason-code",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "An access restriction must carry a non-blank reason code; a blank one is refused and the Skill's restriction is unchanged. A restriction is lifted with none, not blank."
          },
          {
            "id": "an-account-purge-erases-a-skill-only-its-own-workspace-holds",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "An account purge erases the content of a skill that only the workspace's own Runs or frozen test cases hold: every version loses its manifest and import source, its package object goes to collection, the skill loses its summary and search entry, and the version rows stay so those Runs still point at them. A skill another workspace forked, bundled or downloaded keeps its content. Every skill the purge keeps is marked deleted and leaves search, so the deletion sweep removes it once nothing holds it any more."
          },
          {
