            "summary": "A simulated answer refused because the conversation has no further round closes the trial instead of failing the batch."
          },
          {
            "id": "batch-waits-only-on-a-passing-refusal",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "An evaluation batch waits when Run refuses a trial with a refusal Run says will pass on its own, including a run quota that could not be counted; pauses with the reason recorded when the refusal is one the owner can outwait or fix, a credit top-up or a used-up daily or windowed run quota; and stops with the reason recorded on any other refusal."
          },
          {
            "id": "batches-are-compared-only-on-test-cases-both-judged",
            "status": "reviewed",
            "summary": "Two batches are compared only on test cases judged in both; a test case judged in only one counts as unpaired, not as better, worse or tied."
          },
