      {
        "id": "a-lost-attempts-model-key-is-revoked-before-reassignment",
        "statement": "When a Run's attempt is lost with its provider, the platform asks the model gateway to revoke that attempt's model key before it dispatches the next attempt, so the lost sandbox cannot keep spending on a key the Run no longer uses. A revocation the gateway refuses is counted and left to cleanup, which revokes it again.",
